DesNumNgb                   32
SofteningGas                0.1
SofteningHalo               0.1
SofteningDisk               0.1
SofteningBulge              0.1
SofteningStars              0.1
SofteningBndry              0.1
SGChemTablesPath            sgchem_tables          % overridden by the test
SGChemCosmicRayIonRate      2.0e-16     % s^-1 per H
